    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "「ChatGPT」最有意思的地方，是结果本身，还是它重新定义问题的方式？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "指令调优模型已经改善了对用户请求的遵循，但公众此前主要通过 API 和演示接触它们。ChatGPT 把这条后训练路线与持续对话界面结合，并以公开研究预览形式发布。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-chatgpt-instructgpt-background", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "ChatGPT 使用监督式对话样例和 RLHF 训练，数据收集时训练人员同时扮演用户与助手。对话格式把之前的轮次纳入上下文，从而支持追问、纠正和迭代任务。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-chatgpt-instructgpt-background", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "那它为什么没有停留在一篇论文或一次实验里？后来研究者真正继承了什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "专家通常把 ChatGPT 视为让大语言模型成为主流计算界面的产品事件。它的遗产既包括对话式 AI 部署加速，也包括围绕幻觉、劳动、教育、版权和治理展开的更广泛讨论。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-chatgpt-instructgpt-background", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "当今天的系统规模越来越大时，「ChatGPT」留下的思路还有哪些价值，又有哪些边界值得重新追问？",
